From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bf39l <boliu1234@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] rewriter/nro: separate writable data from executable Mac
 pages

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: small NROs must not put writable globals on an executable 16 KB Mac page
Issue: https://github.com/bf39l/nxnative/tree/fix/nro-shared-host-page

Move overlapping NRO data and bss onto their own Mac page and rebase the
module metadata, relocations and PC-relative references. Keep original
registration hashes and already separated layouts unchanged. Include the
layout helper in rewrite cache keys so existing game builds refresh it.

Native page-protection regression and NRO tests pass. FF8 1.0.0's capture
host loaded the two affected modules and captured 34 shaders in 45 seconds.
Gameplay remains unverified.
